{"version":1,"content":"<p>萬聖節剛過去，香港持牌酒吧會所聯會表示，由上周末至萬聖節正日周末，香港酒吧業整體生意額按年上升約30%。</p><p>當中，中環、銅鑼灣、尖沙嘴等地區表現亮眼，個別熱門地段酒吧營業增長超過50%。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.910195+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T02:18:07.082638+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"671925643f6356fee14d7c1a473d8eec1b4195a868041821167a5bef9bede77e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}